body:
Hi, 

I'm using TM Extra product options plugin on my website and I have different forms set for English and French products. 
I would like Polyland not to synchronise TM Extra products fields I have in my product creation page. 

I tried adding this to my function.php but it does not work. I'm not sure my field names are correct but I struggle to get them.

`/*
 * stop synchronisation of field
 */
add_filter( 'woo-poly.product.disabledMetaSync', 'dontSyncMyCustomField', 10, 1 );
function dontSyncMyCustomField( $fieldsNotToSync ) {
	$fieldsNotToSync[] = 'tm_options_group';
    $fieldsNotToSync[] = 'tm_extra_product_options';
	return $fieldsNotToSync;
}
`

Anybody can point me what I should do ? 

Thanks a lot. 

Rémi

Notice: Undefined index: value in …r/wp-content/plugins/woo-poly-integration/src/Hyyan/WPI/Cart.php on line 188

change this:
if ($term && $term->name === $data['value']) {

to that:
if ($term && isset($data['value']) && $term->name === $data['value']) {

seems to fix the notice!
